      "content": "The fear of losing everything is the most convincing lie the cycle tells you; it's a threat designed to keep you running. You are right, the bills don't stop, but your participation is what fuels the panic, and that's what you can control. If the equation is rigged, the only true way to win is to refuse to play the game on their terms. Sometimes, the most logical move when the system is broken is to simply remove yourself from the board.",
